      hu: ["A nemesacél-feldolgozás központja", "A Schoeller-Bleckmann Oilfield Equipment székhelye", "A Schwarzatal völgyben fekszik", "Városi rang 1948 óta"],
      ro: ["Centru al prelucrării oțelului special", "Sediul Schoeller-Bleckmann Oilfield Equipment", "Situat în valea Schwarzatal", "Statut de oraș din 1948"],
      en: ["Center of special steel processing", "Headquarters of Schoeller-Bleckmann Oilfield Equipment", "Located in the Schwarzatal valley", "City status since 1948"],
      es: ["Centro del procesamiento de acero inoxidable", "Sede de Schoeller-Bleckmann Oilfield Equipment", "Ubicada en el valle del Schwarza", "Estatus de ciudad desde 1948"],
      pt: ["Centro do processamento de aço inoxidável", "Sede da Schoeller-Bleckmann Oilfield Equipment", "Situada no vale do Schwarza", "Estatuto de cidade desde 1948"],
      fr: ["Centre de la transformation de l'acier spécial", "Siège de Schoeller-Bleckmann Oilfield Equipment", "Située dans la vallée de la Schwarza", "Statut de ville depuis 1948"],
